Z||000000||x cuda man||01-20-2000||11:40 PM||||i was just reading the thead paint my wagon and just wanted to let everbody know about this german paint,SPIES HECKER.i used to work in a big indenpendent body shop with a very good rep.we tested about every thing out there and were spraying PPG and getting great jobs, but our bill with the paint store was getting out of hand because we had to keep so many different chemicals to paint with because they dont cross mix with each other.in came SPIES!with this product you use the same hardners,reducers in everything they got,use the same for the primer,basecoat,clearcoat,sealer,everything!just 3 hardners,fast,med,slow.you can lay the primer on thick because it's a high build,(up to 10mm thick and it send's like butter,it's even yellow)but thats not the good part!the base lays down great,dont get hot and lift and the CLEAR LOOKS LIKE GLASS!!!after just 2 trips to the paint room with the thick ass clearcoat YOUR CAR WILL BE SLICK!(it's high solids and i do mean clear!it's not yellow looking like alot of the others!)and the best part for FIERO OWNERS is they've got a plastic system that's second to none!you spray a thin plastic primer and add a flex agent then ZIP BANG BOOM!WA,LA INSTANT FLEXABLE PAINT.this is THE product to use on THE FIERO .this stuff will last to!(this is the same products that come oem on PORSCH,MERCEDES,VW,AUDI)just look at a older american car,then look at a older german car,you be the judge!we tested the flex system on a plastic ball filled with air,AND IT DID NOT CRACK UP!!!if you are looking for a splash and go,then forget this stuff,this is for people that will spend the time to get a show quality job because i tell ya IT WILL DELIVER!!!!!im not saying that ther's no other good paints out there,it's just i have seen this stuff first hand!we worked on mostly newer cars but we painted a 69 Z28 that a man had been restoring for 5 years and spent 25,000 on,and the first show it entered he got first place with it!and we just did it like any other car!(this was a major show!)if you are going to paint your car yourself you sould'nt have to spend more than 350.00 on suplies.just take your time,prep,prep,prep and use good guns.check out there web site. go usa then product click PERMACRON. theyve got a screen saver thats cool to,it morfs cool cars on your screen and it's free to!http://www.spieshecker.com ||||reg||14
